"""The code points `swapcase` leaves alone despite their mappings.

These are the titlecase characters. They are in neither case, so there
is no other case to write them in, and both of their mappings would
move them if the mappings were all a caller had to go on.
"""

comptime LOWEST_CORRECTED_LEAD = Byte(0xC3)
"""The first byte of the lowest code point in the table.

An element with no byte this large in it holds nothing that needs
correcting, which is every ASCII element and most others, and that test
is one pass over the bytes with no decoding in it.
"""
